      "menu\nB-O•A•C",
      "BOAC\nAND BOAC CUNARD\nNew York - London\nBar Service\nWhisky - Gin - Rum - Vodka - Martini Sweet or Dry\nBrandy V.S.O.P.\nLiqueurs\nSelected French Wines from Burgundy and Bordeaux ‡ Bottles\nChampagne ‡ Bottles\nSherry - Vermouth\nEnglish Beer\nLager\nCigarettes\nPackets of 20's English or American\nPlain or Filter Tip\nPlease see Flight Companion for Bar Tariff\nIf so desired a selected fish course is available on Fridays\nMenu\nCanapé Balmoral\nCornish Game Hen with Wild Rice\nMacedoine of Vegetables\nLyonnaise Potatoes\nPineapple Gâteau\nCheese • Cream Crackers\nCoffee\n•Tea\nAfternoon Tea\nVarious Sandwiches\nFruit Cake\nCoffee • Tea\nKEC/IB\n1265"
